\newlabel{fig:sacheb}{{3}{7}{The \sacheb {} gradient shear. The only design choice is which $W$ enters $K^{*}$: the Clenshaw--Curtis weights ($\Wc $) or constant weights ($\Wu $). Both give an \emph {exactly} symplectic block---in different forms. That choice, not the presence of symplecticity, is what the experiments vary}{figure.caption.12}{}}
